      "title": "Data Warehouse Performance Optimization",
      "description": "Optimized data warehouse queries reducing runtime by 80% and improving dashboard performance",
      "longDescription": "Led a comprehensive data warehouse optimization project focusing on query performance, indexing strategies, and data modeling improvements. Analyzed slow-running queries, implemented partitioning strategies, and redesigned dimensional models for better performance. Created automated monitoring for query performance and established best practices for SQL development. Achieved 80% reduction in average query runtime and improved dashboard load times from 2 minutes to 15 seconds.",
